#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:2
msgid "General"
msgstr "Generale"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:7
msgid "New document"
msgstr "Nuovo documento"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:9
msgid "To create a new document:"
msgstr "Per creare un nuovo documento:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:11
msgid "From anywhere on CryptPad: :kbd:`Ctrl+e`."
msgstr "Ovunque su CryptPad: :kbd:`Ctrl+e`."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:12
msgid "From the CryptDrive:"
msgstr "Dal CryptDrive:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:14
msgid "|plus| **New** in the toolbar."
msgstr "|plus| **Nuovo** nella barra degli strumenti."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:15
msgid "|plus| **New** at the bottom of the file list/grid."
msgstr "|plus| **Nuovo** in fondo alla lista/griglia del documento."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:17
msgid "From a document: |file-o| **File** > |plus| **New**."
msgstr "Da un documento: |file-o| **File** > |plus| **Nuovo**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:22
msgid ":badge_user:`Logged in users`"
msgstr ":badge_user:`Utenti registrati/e`"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:24
msgid ""
"The creation screen offers a number of options when new documents are "
"created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Owned document**: Create the new document as :ref:`owner <owners>`. If "
"the document is created without an owner this setting cannot be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Expiring document**: Specify an expiry date after which the document "
"will be destroyed. This setting cannot be modified after the document is "
"created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Add a password**: Secure the sharing of the document with a "
":ref:`password <passwords>`. This setting can be changed later in the "
":ref:`access` menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Template**: Choose to start from a blank document or use a "
":ref:`template <templates>` as a starting point."
msgstr ""
"**Modello**: Scegli se aprire un documento vuoto o usare un "
":ref:`modello<templates>` come punto di partenza."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:36
msgid ""
"All templates saved in CryptDrive or in teams that you are part of appear"
" on the creation screen. To save a document as a template:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the open document: |file-o| **File** > |cptools new-template| **Save "
"as template**."
msgstr ""
"Nel documento aperto: |file-o| **File** > |cptools new-template| **Salva "
"come modello**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:40
msgid "or"
msgstr "o"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:42
msgid ""
"In the CryptDrive: Drag the document to the |cptools template| "
"**Templates** folder."
msgstr ""
"Sul CryptDrive: Trascina il documento nella cartella |cptools template| "
"**Modelli**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:47
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "Salvataggio in corso"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:49
msgid ""
"Changes to documents are saved automatically. The status line in the "
"document toolbar (under the title) confirms that changes have been saved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:54
msgid "Make a copy"
msgstr "Fai una copia"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:56
msgid "To duplicate a document:"
msgstr "Per duplicare un documento:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:58
msgid "From the document: |file-o| **File** > |clone| **Make a copy**."
msgstr "Dal documento: |file-o| **File** > |clone| **Fai una copia**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:59
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive: ``Right click`` on the document > |clone| **Make a "
"copy**."
msgstr ""
"Dal CryptDrive: ``Clic sul tasto destro del mouse`` sul documento > |clone| "
"**Fai una copia**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:64
msgid ""
"Make a copy can be used to purge history from a file, for example if you "
"want to redact content from the history and/or make it completely "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:68
msgid ""
"Beware, an important caveat of using Make a copy is that you'll have to "
"share again the document with your contacts or the persons you sent the "
"link to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:73
msgid "Document history"
msgstr "Cronologia dei documenti"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:78
msgid "The history toolbar"
msgstr "Barra degli strumenti della cronologia"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:80
msgid ""
"The history of documents is saved and can be restored if needed. To view "
"and restore the history of a document:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:82
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |history| **History**."
msgstr "|file-o| **File** > |history| **Cronologia**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:83
msgid "Use the arrows to navigate:"
msgstr "Usa le frecce per navigare:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:85
msgid "|step-backward| and |step-forward| between each edit."
msgstr "|step-backward| e |step-forward| tra ogni modifica."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:86
msgid "|step-backward| |user| and |user| |step-forward| between each author."
msgstr "|step-backward| |user| e |user| |step-forward| tra ogni autore/autrice."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:87
msgid ""
"|step-backward| |users| and |users| |step-forward| between each editing "
"session (when the same group of authors was connected to the document)."
msgstr ""
"|step-backward| |users| e |users| |step-forward| tra ogni sessione di "
"modifica (quando lo stesso gruppo di autori/autrici era connesso al "
"documento)."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:89
msgid ""
"Restore the displayed version with |check| **Restore** , or close the "
"history without restoring with |times| **Close**."
msgstr ""
"Ripristina la versione visualizzata con |check| **Ripristina** o chiudi la "
"cronologia senza ripristinare con |times| **Chiudi**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:92
msgid ""
"To save storage space, history can be deleted in the document’s "
":ref:`properties <document_properties>` :badge_owner:`Document owners`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:95
msgid ""
"The history functionality works slightly differently in the "
":ref:`app_sheets` application, due to the integration of OnlyOffice with "
"CryptPad's encrypted real-time collaboration. Please refer to "
":ref:`spreadsheet history <sheets_history>` for further details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:97
msgid "**Version Links**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:99
msgid "To share a link to the displayed version of the history:"
msgstr ""
"Per condividere un link verso la versione visualizzata della cronologia:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:101
msgid "|share-alt| **Share** in the toolbar."
msgstr "|share-alt| **Condividi** nella barra degli strumenti."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:102
msgid ""
"Select **Contacts**, **Link** or **Embed** similarly to when "
":ref:`sharing a document <share>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:104
msgid "Recipients will be able to view the selected version in read-only mode."
msgstr ""
"I/Le destinatari/e potranno vedere la versione selezionata in modalità di "
"sola lettura."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:107
msgid ""
"Sharing a link to a version also gives read-only access to all versions "
"of the document."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:111
msgid "**Create a snapshot from history**"
msgstr "**Crea un'istantanea dalla cronologia**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:113
msgid ""
"To create a :ref:`snapshot <snapshots>` from the displayed version of the"
" history:"
msgstr ""
"Per creare un' :ref:`istantanea <snapshots>` dalla versione visualizzata "
"della cronologia:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:115
msgid "|camera| button in the toolbar."
msgstr "Pulsante |camera| nella barra degli strumenti."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:116 ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:134
msgid "In the dialog, provide a name for the snapshot."
msgstr "Dai un nome all'istantanea nella finestra di dialogo."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:117 ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:135
msgid "|camera| **New Snapshot**"
msgstr "|camera| **Nuova Istantanea**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:122
msgid "Snapshots"
msgstr "Istantanee"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:127
msgid "The snapshots dialog"
msgstr "Finestra di dialogo delle istantanee"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:129
msgid ""
"Snapshots are specific points in the history of a document that are named"
" for easy reference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:131
msgid "To create a snapshot from the current state of the document:"
msgstr "Per creare un'istantanea dello stato attuale del documento:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:133 ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:141
#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:148
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |camera| **Snapshots**"
msgstr "|file-o| **File** > |camera| **Istantanee**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:137
msgid ""
"To create a snapshot from a version in the document's history see "
":ref:`snapshot from history <document_history>` above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:139
msgid "To view and restore a snapshot:"
msgstr "Per vedere e ripristinare un'istantanea:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:142
msgid "In the dialog, ``Click`` on the snapshot in the list and |eye| **View**."
msgstr ""
"Nella finestra di dialogo, ``Clicca`` sull'istantanea nella lista e |eye| "
"**Visualizza**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:143
msgid "The snapshot opens in a new window."
msgstr "L'istantanea si apre in una nuova finestra."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:144
msgid "|check| **Restore** or |times| **Close**"
msgstr "|check| **Ripristina** o |times| **Chiudi**"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:146
msgid "To delete a snapshot:"
msgstr "Per eliminare un'istantanea:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:149
msgid ""
"In the dialog, ``Click`` on the snapshot in the list and |trash| "
"**Delete**."
msgstr ""
"Nella finestra di dialogo, ``Clicca`` sull'istantanea nella lista e |trash| "
"**Elimina**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:154
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Proprietà"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:159
msgid "To access the properties menu:"
msgstr "Per accedere al menu delle proprietà:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:161
msgid "From the document: |file-o| **File** > |info-circle| **Properties**."
msgstr "Dal documento: |file-o| **File** > |info-circle| **Proprietà**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:163
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive: ``Right click`` on the document > |info-circle| "
"**Properties**."
msgstr ""
"Dal CryptDrive:``Clic sul tasto destro del mouse`` sul documento > |info-"
"circle| **Proprietà**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:166
msgid "Available data:"
msgstr "Dati disponibili:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:168
msgid ""
"Document identifier to share with instance administrators in case of an "
"issue. (note that this does not expose the content of of the document)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:169
msgid "Links to edit and view (depending on your permissions)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:170
msgid "Dates of creation and last access."
msgstr "Date di creazione e dell'ultimo accesso."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:171
msgid "Size."
msgstr "Dimensione."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:173
msgid ""
"The document size shows the proportions used for content and for history."
" To save storage space, delete the document’s history with **Delete "
"history** and confirm. :badge_owner:`Document owners`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:176
msgid ""
":ref:`snapshots` are part of the document's history. If you delete the "
"history in the document's properties snapshots will be deleted as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:182
msgid "Users and chat"
msgstr "Utenti e chat"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:184
msgid ""
"Interact with users connected to the same document through the user-list "
"|user| |eye| and the |comments| **Chat**."
msgstr ""
"Interagisci con gli/le utenti connessi/e allo stesso documento tramite la "
"lista degli/delle utenti |user| |eye| e la |comments| **Chat**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:187
msgid "To show/hide these panes:"
msgstr "Per mostrare/nascondere queste finestre:"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:189
msgid "|user| |eye| for the user-list."
msgstr "|user| |eye| per la lista degli/delle utenti."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/general.rst:190
msgid "|comments| **Chat** for the chat."
msgstr "|comments| **Chat** per la chat."

